            "name": "Rotate signing secret",
            "description": {
              "content": "Mint a fresh HMAC signing secret, returned ONCE (stored encrypted, never retrievable again). Requires an existing endpoint (set a URL first). Deliveries signed with the old secret stop verifying immediately.",
